WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:01,940
No more

2
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:03,770
My dormitory is right in front

3
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:06,490
Then if I say

4
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:10,800
I must take Miss Jian back to the dormitory, sir.

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,790
It's time to get off work now

6
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:20,120
How about Miss Jian just treating it as working overtime?

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,610
I don't have any life

8
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,730
It means Shen Xiujin

9
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:27,010
Even Sister Su Meng doesn’t dare to give me jobs anymore.

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,700
If this continues

11
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,400
How can I save five million in a month?

12
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,320
do something for you

13
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,640
in exchange for your tip

14
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,760
Nothing needs to be done

15
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,680
I just need to sit next to me

16
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:43,030
Let me take you back to your dormitory sir

17
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:44,990
Let me cook you a bowl of scallion noodles

18
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,740
I can't think of anything better to entertain you.

19
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:51,010
There are only noodles, green onions and some eggs left in the dormitory

20
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:53,530
it uses the best it can

21
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:58,320
Come and exchange it for this little bit of money in my hand.
